### Valid webhook delivery (fresh timestamp & valid signature)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/payouts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Timestamp: {{webhookTimestamp}}
X-Signature: {{webhookSignature}}

{
  "type": "payout.succeeded",
  "data": {
    "payout_id": "po_01JVABCDXYZ",
    "amount": 1000,
    "currency": "ZAR",
    "status": "succeeded"
  }
}

### Rejected: old timestamp (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/payouts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Timestamp: 1600000000
X-Signature: v1=invalid

{
  "type": "payout.succeeded",
  "data": { "payout_id": "po_01JVABCDXYZ" }
}
